Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:12.61,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I guess I'm dating Senpai now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:16.95,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Even after everything, \Nit still seems unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:20.16,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,My feet feel like they're floating in air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:22.21,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.43,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Want something before we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.43,0:00:25.03,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,Uh... I'll leave that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.41,0:00:27.91,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then let's get the roasted corn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.91,0:00:30.65,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We could get the potatoes \Nwith the butter on top, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.21,0:00:33.09,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's talking \Nabout the Jagabutter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:37.05,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's certainly used to\N this stuff, isn't he...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:41.38,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Even though my heart's been \Npounding hard this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:46.20,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder how long you hold hands for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.31,0:00:51.05,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,My palms are sweaty, and I wonder if this \Nmakes it harder for him to walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:56.11,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh! Isn't that the grilled corn?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.68,0:00:58.74,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,Let's really take a look \Naround while we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.06,0:01:01.49,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,What do you normally eat \Nat festivals, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.49,0:01:04.53,flashbacktop,YOI,0,0,0,,I eat baby castellas, candy \Napples, choco bananas...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.92,0:01:05.11,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's go then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.53,0:01:06.22,flashbacktop,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh gosh, it's all the sweet stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:36.32,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,All right, let's start heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.77,0:01:40.57,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It'll be dangerous if we get separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.79,0:01:45.32,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,B-But my hands are sweaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:46.59,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Like I care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:50.17,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,And, I'm still sort of embarrassed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:54.01,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then you better get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.35,0:01:56.68,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I dunno what to do otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.22,0:02:01.00,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:10.35,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,We're really "boyfriend" \Nand "girlfriend," huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.93,0:02:14.55,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He looked so different \Nfrom his usual self.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:21.09,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Yoi! Please clean up your yukata. Yoi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.29,0:02:30.11,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Someday, we'll be doing that \Nsort of thing, too, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.25,0:02:32.24,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:38.33,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Now that it's official, how\Nshould I behave at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:42.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know what? I got a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.49,0:02:43.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,My honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.59,0:02:47.00,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.06,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnImpact\b1\bord1.5\fs40\c&HB161E2&\3c&H8831B9&\frz347.5\move(700,190,-130,0)}Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.06,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnImpact\b1\bord4.5\fs40\c&HB161E2&\3c&HF9F5E9&\frz347.5\move(700,190,-130,0)}Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:49.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,O-Oh, gosh, I can see it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.92,Default,NOBARA AND KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.77,0:04:25.41,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:27.82,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I figured that's what happened afterwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:29.59,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Must be real nice.\NYour first boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:30.66,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You up on cloud nine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:35.00,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, are you guys \Nfree at lunch today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:46.77,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Don't think I've ever heard you \Nhum a tune before, Ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.77,0:04:48.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:50.71,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Sheesh, must be nice to be so carefree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:55.14,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,The festival got super awkward \Nafter you ran off, Ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:56.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,My b, my b.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:05:00.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's just that, you see, \NI started dating Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:01.84,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:02.85,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:03.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:06.75,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,For real?! You didn't feed her \Na line or anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:09.16,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,You didn't drug her, did you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:12.66,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sentaro-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:12.66,top,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Ow ow ow ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:15.16,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Good for you. Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:19.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Kuwa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.49,0:05:22.30,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Wha? You pulled a wrestling move on {\i1}me{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:24.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fs8\an1\c&H54524B&\pos(278,246.667)}You have a new message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:24.38,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fs8\an1\c&H54524B&\pos(278,223.334)}You have a new message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:24.51,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fs8\an1\c&H54524B&\pos(278,202.667)}You have a new message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:24.63,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fs8\an1\c&H54524B&\pos(278,189.334)}You have a new message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:25.34,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fs8\an1\c&H54524B&\pos(278,186.667)}You have a new message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:25.40,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fs8\an1\c&H54524B&\pos(278,186.667)\clip(m 272 177 l 351 180 362 182 369 190 262 187)}You have a new message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:28.52,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Would you like to have lunch with \Nme in the old school building?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:36.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Um, three of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:37.85,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Is that not okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:41.96,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, it's okay if it's \Nevery {\i1}once{\i0} in a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:43.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Like once a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:45.02,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:46.53,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Thanks for having us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:48.62,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:50.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:51.58,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Kinda happened on a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Go away, shoo shoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:57.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, since you're here, you're \Nboth welcome to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:05:58.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:10.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously, what is this?\NAre we having a meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:12.28,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Now that we're officially dating,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:15.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I thought it would be good to properly \Nintroduce each other's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:21.15,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I suppose I could think of \Nit as two families meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.39,0:06:23.40,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, you're Tone-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.11,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:26.35,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Wasn't the picture you drew in art class
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:27.86,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,the one they put up by the entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:28.82,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.59,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Seriously? What was the picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:32.38,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,It was a sculpture-like thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:35.58,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing! Could you \Nshow me one next time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:40.20,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I-I'm not that great, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:42.78,italics,KOTOBUKI; YOI,0,0,0,,She's blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:49.22,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fnComic Sans MS\fs15\c&H6E6D63&\pos(406.667,114)\frz28.45\frx20\fry316}School\NMotto
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:49.22,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fnComic Sans MS\fs15\c&H7D8684&\frx20\fry316\an7\fscx70\fscy90\frz29.89\fax-.4\pos(202,274.667)}Steady progress towards your goal,\Nwith sober and irreproachable conduct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:48.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Anyways, I wanted to talk to you about\Nour future relationship plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:54.18,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(382,0)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\c&H728080&\fs10\an1\frz7.122\pos(226.001,280)}Regarding future\Nrelationship plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:54.18,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I thought it would be best for \Neveryone to be on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:58.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The most important point is \Ngradually revealing our relationship,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:03.65,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,over the course of six months to a year, \Nto people outside the six who are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:05.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Then, just to be safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:08.44,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,when walking home together, we should let \Nthe other person know in advance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:09.99,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,and walk three meters apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:11.65,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,When walking side by side,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:14.24,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,be sure to do it at least two \Nkilometers away from the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.45,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Regarding dates and other things...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:17.70,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hold up. Stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:21.46,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Um, we {\i1}are{\i0} dating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:22.30,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:29.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then why do we have to hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:34.97,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Because a lot of people\N look up to you, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:37.88,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And since we're both high school students,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.22,0:07:41.69,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\fs15\an7\fade(654,0)\pos(14,20)\c&H212C2B&}-As a basic rule, plans should be discussed and\Ndecided more than a week in advance.\N-Avoid areas where the school staff can see us\Ntogether.\N-Be mindful to behave appropriately and maintain\Nproper manners as a high school student.\N(Avoid excessive physical contact.)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:41.69,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(654,0)\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&HBED0D0&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 258 0 258 50 0 50
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:41.69,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,it's important to maintain a reasonable \Ndistance and remain modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:43.58,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan is such a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:45.11,italics,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh, something must have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:47.27,italics,SENTARO; SHUN,0,0,0,,Did you do something to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:57.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I'll read it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:08:00.45,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hey! Not later, please read it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:04.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Besides, I have class duties today \Nso I can't walk home with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:05.47,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.47,0:08:07.40,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please answer properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:07.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yesh, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:09.74,italics,KOTOBUKI; NOBARA; SHUN; AND SENTARO,0,0,0,,They're flirting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:08.98,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Enunciate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:09.74,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:10.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,More properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:18.86,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Jeez, am I really the only \None thinking about the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:22.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh? Hey, what are the chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:24.77,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:28.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What do you mean? I was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:29.30,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:32.50,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yep, sorry, I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:34.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I was actually called to \Nthe office for detention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.81,0:08:37.68,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But since I'm here, do you \Nwanna walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:39.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? You in a bad mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:49.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Uh, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:54.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How long do we have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.90,0:08:57.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Until we're more than two \Nkilometers away from the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:09:00.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:05.05,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... And for a moment, \NI was so happy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.05,0:09:06.48,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And now it's "since I'm here."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:10.44,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Wait, wasn't I the one who \Ndecided how things should be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:12.65,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\c&H729EA9&\fs10\an1\frz8.87\pos(271.334,161.333)}Regarding future\Nrelationship plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:12.03,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Am I contradicting myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:15.90,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You mentioned detention.\NDid you do something again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:18.87,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah... this and that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.13,0:09:20.62,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What do you mean "this and that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:23.50,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, it's like that thing, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:24.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What is "that thing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:26.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,More like...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:28.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I was lying about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:31.24,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What? Why would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:36.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,'Cause I wanted to be \Nalone with you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.67,0:09:38.91,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'll have you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:42.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm already super infatuated with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.18,0:09:47.06,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,I want you to be completely \Ninfatuated with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:52.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know... Don't make me say it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:59.71,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I see. Even just now, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.69,0:10:01.81,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.75,0:10:04.93,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:06.68,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:07.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:14.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.55,0:10:27.56,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, about the plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:30.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What do you say we reconsider it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:34.91,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know, Yoi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:37.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Just when I'm trying my best to be good,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:40.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,you seriously go off and pull \Nstuff like that on me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:43.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you mean? Pull what stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:45.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, it's all good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:50.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But seriously, please get used to \Nit as quickly as you can, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.35,0:10:58.95,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,There's no way people's feelings \Ngo as planned, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:04.70,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I said I'll reconsider it, but I don't \Nknow if I'll change anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:05.79,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:13.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, what are ya gonna do about the \N"two kilometers away from school" rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,That's something that \Nneeds to be considered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:17.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, can I buy ice cream \Nat the convenience store?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:21.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's almost time for my first \Nsummer break with a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.52,top,YOI,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:25.70,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:27.66,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I'm excited about summer break,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:30.08,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,but the closing ceremony is \Nsuch a pain, don't ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:34.50,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Calling everyone into the \Ngym in this heat is just ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:37.49,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Right? At least put on the air \Nconditioner or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.49,0:11:38.43,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:39.72,Default,GIRL IN BACKGROUND,0,0,0,,He's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.02,0:11:42.76,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Just as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:45.08,Default,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Oh! Is that Ichimura-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:46.05,Default,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:49.59,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh! Yoi-chan, it's the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:50.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.27,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(48,0)\fs32\bord2\fnImpact\b1\c&H0C97F0&\3c&H30D2F1&\pos(516,14.667)\frz14.78}Kya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.27,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(48,0)\fs32\bord2\fnImpact\b1\c&HB93581&\3c&HE78EC7&\pos(138,24.667)\frz357}Kya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.27,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(48,0)\fs40\bord2\fnImpact\b1\c&H3500E3&\3c&H9E79F2&\pos(348.667,177.334)\frz5.734}Kya{\c&HE5E7E7&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:11:59.89,top,CLASSMATE GIRL A,0,0,0,,He just waved at me, didn't he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.51,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,There go the meaningless\N arguments again...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:01.14,top,CLASSMATE GIRL C,0,0,0,,To me, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:02.99,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Well, that one packed quite a punch...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:02.47,top,CLASSMATE GIRL B,0,0,0,,No! He was waving at {\i1}me{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.77,0:12:07.47,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I see. So this is what a \Nsense of superiority feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:10.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Something similar happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:15.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm surprised at how my \Nfeelings have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:18.13,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs15\c&HBFB7B8&\move(302.667,115,305,-10,0,2380)\frz3.429\frx2\fry350}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:20.34,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi! You can clock out soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:21.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:26.78,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fs10\an1\c&H3E4F4B&\frz15.86\pos(292,182)}You have a new message.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:29.47,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Let me know when you're done with work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:43.82,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:47.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you... for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:51.40,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry for asking right \Nafter work. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:53.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You don't always have \Nto give me something...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:56.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. Something \Nfor making it to summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:57.46,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:00.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Mr. Papico Distributor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:03.67,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.97,0:13:06.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Do you have any plans for summer break?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:07.26,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:10.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, y'know, vacation \Nwith family and what not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:12.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, I mostly work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:15.08,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I was also asked to tutor \Nmy neighbor's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:17.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wow, I can totally see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.09,0:13:18.97,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Do you have plans, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.97,0:13:21.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm? Oh, nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:24.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But I thought we could hang out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:25.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:28.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, I {\i1}am{\i0} your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.40,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:35.79,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.79,0:13:40.46,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But I kind of feel bad for asking \Nyou to go out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:44.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I've been wondering. Why do you \Nhave such low self-esteem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.63,0:13:46.28,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.28,0:13:48.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I thought it was normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:49.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's super low.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:51.68,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's not normal to say stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:53.90,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, when are you free?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:57.39,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:14:01.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Monday through Friday I have work, \Nand I'll tutor on the weekends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.64,0:14:04.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,After my radio exercises,\NI do have two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:06.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Two hours? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:08.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How about in the morn—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:10.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Mornings are reserved\Nfor my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.61,0:14:13.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.03,0:14:16.96,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh? I might have... these two days off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:18.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:19.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,San?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:21.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Please give me both of those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:25.26,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sure, but was there something \Nyou wanted to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.26,0:14:28.59,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Maybe something I want to do, \Nmaybe somewhere I want to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:30.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How about a short trip to Kobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:32.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,K-Kobe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:33.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yes, Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:38.39,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,B-But isn't it a bit far \Nto go for a day trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:41.15,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's all right. We have a villa in Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:45.07,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I forgot this guy is rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.66,0:14:50.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You {\i1}do{\i0} mean a day trip, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:52.66,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.03,0:14:55.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:57.52,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We'd be in separate rooms, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.30,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,That's not the problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.30,0:15:03.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wha? But Kobe has a lot of delicious \NWestern confectionery stores...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:09.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,There's cheesecake, Baumkuchen, \Nstuff with cream on top,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:12.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,stuff with cream inside, \Ncheesecake and more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:17.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I'll go, if I can bring my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:20.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:22.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, my bad, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.41,0:15:24.79,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, that was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:28.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Your determination wavers when \Nsweets are involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:32.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay. Then let's have fun \Nin Kobe as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:33.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, he's okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:37.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, it's getting late, \Nso I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.95,0:15:43.67,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\shad0.5\bord0\b1\c&H53451E&\3c&H231802&\frx336\fry310\pos(261.333,17.333)\frz327.3}Shark Park
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:39.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm fine on my own.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.63,0:15:39.88,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:41.64,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's dangerous for a girl to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:43.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:47.93,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's treating me\Nmore and more like a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:50.88,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan. Hold still...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:52.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:58.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,There's a huge bug on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:15:59.74,italics,PRAYING MANTIS,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:05.23,italics,PRAYING MANTIS,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:06.84,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:07.50,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:10.22,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You're okay with bugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:12.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm not good with them, \Nbut I can touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.57,0:16:14.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Y-You're so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.60,0:16:15.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:18.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,After everything, {\i1}that's{\i0}\Nwhat makes you think I'm cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.19,0:16:20.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I just can't deal with bugs at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:23.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, I didn't mean—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:28.04,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong \Nbeing this close, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:31.26,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Let's stay like this for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:35.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you saying? \NWe're in public!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:37.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine.\NNo one can see us in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.87,0:16:39.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No good?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:41.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:48.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Maybe... just for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:04.60,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai's smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:10.12,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Until recently, I never thought \NI'd be holding him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:19.96,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, shi—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:25.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I...\N It was just on impulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:28.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry, it wasn't intentional.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:28.77,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\t(0,100,\fs32)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&HAE4EA2&\bord0\move(308,76,261.333,151.333,0,86)\frz318.4}D-{\c&H9655D7&}D{\c&H946AF5&}a{\c&H8483F5&}s{\c&H81E3F8&}h
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:31.34,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs32\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&HAE4EA2&\bord0\frz322.5\move(261.333,151.333,850,151.333,0,2570)}D-{\c&H9655D7&}D{\c&H946AF5&}a{\c&H8483F5&}s{\c&H81E3F8&}h
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:31.36,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ah, hey, Yoi-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.89,0:17:35.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-san! Yoi-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:38.97,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Kobe?! I'll go, I'll go, I want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:41.08,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,But are you sure it's \Nokay for us to go, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:44.91,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,More like, I'd be bothered\N if you {\i1}didn't{\i0} come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.91,0:17:46.04,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry for the short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:47.41,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:51.00,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Even if you did have to bring us, \Nyou didn't turn him down, Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:54.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, it is summer break, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.19,0:17:58.05,italicstop,SFX,0,0,0,,Yippee!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.19,0:17:56.73,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,That's good. That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:58.20,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,666)\t(0,886,\fs40)\fnComic Sans MS\bord2\b1\c&H6055F2&\3c&H2D2ED0&\pos(260.667,203.334)\frz3.491}That's right{\c&H0BC0F6&\3c&H3BA8E7&}!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:18:00.10,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Let's go to Kobe and dress you up all \Ncute so Senpai's heart skips a beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:02.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But I don't really care what clothes—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.47,0:18:04.86,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.64,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,They look a bit like Senpai's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:32.44,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder... if he'll think it's cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:36.02,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.02,0:18:37.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The train had a delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:39.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry, Oji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:41.15,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:44.14,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,We're not that busy, so it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:46.76,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh? Did you get your ears pierced?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:47.85,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?! Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:49.52,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I forgot to take them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:52.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,They're clip-ons. I just bought them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.27,0:18:56.07,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,They kind of look similar to the\Nones that regular wears.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.28,0:19:00.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:02.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's a common design, and so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:03.99,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:06.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'll just put them in my pocket for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:09.91,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Well, I kinda wondered if the \Ntwo of you were dating or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:13.09,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh! I didn't mean anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:19.23,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:21.82,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.31,0:19:24.28,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:25.35,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Ah! Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.51,0:19:27.22,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:33.52,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Are yukatas... something guys like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.80,0:19:38.25,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,My friend is planning to go to \Nthe summer festival with a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:41.57,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It seems like she's having trouble \Ndeciding whether to wear one that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.39,0:19:44.17,flashback italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:47.24,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Then, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:49.02,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,All...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.41,0:19:56.26,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Um! If it's all right with you, would \Nyou like to go out some time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:57.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:20:00.35,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I-It's my younger sister's \Nbirthday... In August!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:03.82,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,You seem like you'd be good at \Npicking out presents, Yoi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:05.69,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,So if it's possible, I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:10.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I'd be good \Nat it, but all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.47,0:20:11.77,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:15.00,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:17.51,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Coming! Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:23.20,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I know that. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.19,0:20:28.83,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Why did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.70,0:20:33.64,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Traveling with upperclassmen \Nis exciting, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:35.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.01,0:20:38.54,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,But I can't help but notice that you're \Nnot wearing the clothes we bought!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:40.13,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,You're not wearing the earrings either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:43.53,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I couldn't fit everything \Nwhile I was packing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.53,0:20:45.51,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Jeez, that's just what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.23,0:20:49.38,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I actually did bring them, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:52.49,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm still sort of \Nembarrassed to wear them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.49,0:20:53.39,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:54.75,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,We keep you waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.37,0:20:56.94,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:21:02.20,italicstop,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:02.82,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\clip(546,6,570,45)\t(0,1500,\clip(546,6,640,45))\fs40\fnComic Sans MS\bord0\c&HCE191B&\pos(590,6.666)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.85,0:21:00.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:02.82,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.46,0:21:05.40,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I've never seen you\Nin casual clothes before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:06.28,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.28,0:21:08.93,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.\NIt's a new side of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.83,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,It's always your work clothes\Nor school uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:11.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.49,0:21:12.83,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:14.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.69,0:21:16.83,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're forbidden from looking any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:21.59,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,There he goes! Stupid lovebirds!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.59,0:21:23.18,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Shut up, and keep your eyes {\i1}off{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:25.13,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Let's just go ahead and buy our tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:27.95,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Jeez, can't even let \Nmy guard down for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.95,0:21:30.44,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, that's really enough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:31.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm? What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:32.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Shoulder. My shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:35.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Aw, I figured we could stay like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:38.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah, just kiddin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:40.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh man...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.65,0:21:43.42,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,{\i0}Who{\i1} can't let their guard down for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:45.24,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, forgot one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.83,0:21:47.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You look real cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.89,0:21:54.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec on choosing seats!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:56.58,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Of course, we're going with reserved seating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:56.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:58.13,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Womanizer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:08.47,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\t(0,3710,\fs16)\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H4D47A3&\move(228.667,217.333,241.333,214,21,3692)}Yoi on trip
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.47,0:22:15.33,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.25\fade(529,452)\fs18\c&H39211F&\bord0\b1\fnComic Sans MS\t(4408,4860,\c&HFFFFFF&)\frz20.45\pos(342.667,213.332)}Earring
